"""
Banana Scope PH: Philippine Banana Production Analytics (2010–2026)
-------------------------------------------------------------------
Main Interactive Web Application & Advanced Analytics Engine
Built with Streamlit & Plotly Express.

Visual Identity: Tropical Philippine Banana Heritage & Modern AgTech
Color Palette:
  • Banana Yellow  (#F4C542) - Primary highlights, active controls, key metrics
  • Leaf Green     (#387A45) - Navigation, headers, chart accents
  • Forest Green   (#214D32) - Sidebar, dark contrast, structural sections
  • Earthy Brown   (#8B5E3C) - Borders, badges, secondary accents
  • Warm Cream     (#FFF8E7) - Main background and card surfaces

Developed for Fundamentals of Data Analytics
Leuteboro National High School (DepEd MIMAROPA, Oriental Mindoro)
Supervised by Sir Aldrin D. Magtibay, Teacher V

Research Team:
  1. Krishia Mae R. Layag (Project Lead & Data Pipeline Engineer)
